Hi Andreas

On Wed, 16 Aug 2023 at 11:24, Andreas Tille <andreas at an3as.eu> wrote:
> Am Tue, Aug 01, 2023 at 01:06:41PM +0000 schrieb Graham Inggs:
> > At least the following packages are failing their own autopkgtests in
